OL,3,GNEWSACar theft has 'disrupted every
OL,4,Apart of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose car was stolen from her
OL,7,Fdriveway said she and her family have
OL,8,Fbeen left wondering if the thieves will
OL,9,Freturn.
OL,11,FHome Office data analysed by the BBC
OL,12,Ffound West and South Yorkshire were
OL,13,Famong some of the worst areas for car
OL,14,Fthefts across England and Wales.
OL,16,FOf the five police forces with the
OL,17,Fhighest rates of vehicle theft, South
OL,18,FYorkshire ranked third, with 3.1 thefts
OL,19,Fper 1,000 people, while West Yorkshire
OL,20,Franked fifth with 2.4. By comparison,
OL,21,Fthe rate across England and Wales is at
OL,22,F1.9 per 1,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
