OL,3,GNEWSACar theft has 'disrupted every
OL,4,Apart of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Walker, from Upton, near
OL,7,FWakefield, told the BBC: "It's just
OL,8,Fdisrupted every part of my life,
OL,9,Fthrough no fault of my own, because I
OL,10,Fhad a nice car on my drive."
